ns used in apparel, sportswear, hosiery, and industrial applications; dyed acrylic high bulk (Daffodil) yarns used in knitting, weaving, and textile production; acrylic-wool blended yarns used in knitwear, sweaters, and winter apparel; and viscose-nylon blended yarns used in apparel, hosiery, and fashion fabrics. It also produces synthetic fibres consisting of acrylic fibres used in textiles, such as sweaters, blankets, upholstery, and carpets; acrylic hard wastes, including cuttings, selvedge, and defective materials; acrylic tows for further processing into staple fibres and yarns; acrylic soft wastes, including loose fibres, droppings, and shorter lengths of acrylic fibres; and 100% modified polyester yarns used in apparel, home textiles, and technical fabrics. In addition, the company offers fabric and textile products comprising acrylic cloth used in sweaters, blankets, upholstery, and other textile products; and knitted cloth products used in apparel, such as t-shirts, sweaters, active wear, and hosiery. Paramount Syntex Limited was incorporated in 1996 and is headquartered in Ludhiana, India.","employees":355,"earnDates":[],"exDiv":null,"asOf":1795613656},"analyst":null,"cap":"Other","caFix":null,"fetched":1795613656,"source":"Yahoo Finance (public chart, fundamentals-timeseries & quoteSummary endpoints)","news":{"q":"\"Paramount Syntex\" stock when:90d","items":[{"t":"Paramount Syntex Ltd. Share Price Today - Paramount Syntex Ltd. Stock Price Live NSE/BSE","s":"CNBC TV18","d":1795427940,"u":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihgFBVV95cUxQUzh0UEhmUm5OS2Q2bnZEakUxMFBUVlNnQUtpUjBjZXVQNHdXQlN1c0Z5UmVBQzA0c2lEVkdrY1NXSm8xTHdhQTBsOThWYV9wQ215clBuRWxrdEtRSkptaTBtZFEtek5tTG45VTF6TmxOSXNRT1BPSnBtdDA0Tm56ME9GTnRzZw?oc=5","g":[]},{"t":"Paramount Syntex Upper Circuit Today: Price, Data and Peers","s":"Univest","d":1795151220,"u":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiggFBVV95cUxNbGZ1c2JnYXJETDliUmZwNXpIRGlxMGF4cWhkbktlRVhRNTdtOWpRanpSYTB2UXVycXVENUF3ZHZhVUM5Ynh